-grid\"></span></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93c29d1223e0986c8b017a9079c3a749ff82eed1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/93c29d1223e0986c8b017a9079c3a749ff82eed1\" data-origin-width=\"1037\" data-origin-height=\"796\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99765c23685d85f2f9c5216a294fc274cc20a854\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/99765c23685d85f2f9c5216a294fc274cc20a854\" data-origin-width=\"1077\" data-origin-height=\"717\"></div><p>활동지에요.</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97be7ee61bc8a4b9453b79a0c887fca28c1384de\" data-origin-width=\"642\" data-origin-height=\"869\" style=\"width:48.86%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97be7ee61bc8a4b9453b79a0c887fca28c1384de\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3808b8b46dedf3a216057aa5729d6c821782b83c\" data-origin-width=\"586\" data-origin-height=\"777\" style=\"width:49.87%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3808b8b46dedf3a216057aa5729d6c821782b83c\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>2018년 활동지입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59fb8ab607bf634e6f47bd657ab0d8d7d7c271a9?download\" data-file-name=\"지식시장스티커.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1281536\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D378%26fileid%3D16%26regdt%3D20210924235648&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F59fb8ab607bf634e6f47bd657ab0d8d7d7c271a9')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">지식시장스티커</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.22MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/739763e6b80d7e8100a9b89d264447bc9ae280d8?download\" data-file-name=\"지식시장활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"17408\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D378%26fileid%3D17%26regdt%3D20210924235648&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F739763e6b80d7e8100a9b89d264447bc9ae280d8')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">지식시장활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">17.00KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2019년에는 3학년 단원에서 지식시장을 했는데 활동지를 업그레이드 시켰었고, 작년에 2학년 가르치면서 또 지식시장했어요~ 코로나로 조심스러워서 눈치봐가며.. 축소해서 했었습니다 ㅎㅎ</p><p>(2019년에 폼텍라벨지(동전라벨)에 맞게 스티커를 변형해서 사용했었는데 파일은 있으나.. 열리지않네요. 폼텍 사이트에 가서 열어서 사용했던거 같은데.. 잊어버렸습니다...ㅜ)</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/931bb49ed46d24ddbbf5759a6641c0e1308a780e?download\" data-file-name=\"동물과에너지지식시장.hwp\" data-file-size=\"78848\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D378%26fileid%3D18%26regdt%3D20210924235648&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F931bb49ed46d24ddbbf5759a6641c0e1308a780e')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">동물과에너지지식시장</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">77.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b77ca30e4521ad77116eea80cfa7f457d1a768e?download\" data-file-name=\"지식시장스티커.dgz\" data-file-size=\"870713\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D378%26fileid%3D19%26regdt%3D20210924235648&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1b77ca30e4521ad77116eea80cfa7f457d1a768e')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">지식시장스티커</span><span class=\"type\">.dgz</span></div><div class=\"size\">850.31KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>아!! 운영방법은 8모둠 중 소화, 순환, 호흡, 배설 각각 A, B 팀으로 2팀씩 정하고~ (이때 약간 경매하듯. 또는 선착순.. 뭐 이렇게 정하게 하면 아이들이 서로 소화한다, 순환하다 하면서 주제 쟁탈전을 하도록 유도해요~)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2시간정도 자료 준비시간 주고요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>각 모둠에서 두명씩 두팀으로 나누어서, 한팀은 첫시간에 설명, 한팀은 둘째시간에 설명하는 식이에요. 거꾸로 교실 했었어서 설명해 둔 영상이 있네요.(근데 정말 느~무 부끄러운 영상이네요. 목소리도 그렇고.. 뭔말인지 몰겠고.. 컥)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv3k05581bx3nwkwauae91mq3@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frv3k05581bx3nwkwauae91mq3%2Fthumbs%2F3.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33189403736%26signature%3DmVllH9FGaVW5wGwhlnC5VHZGXIk%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv3k05581bx3nwkwauae91mq3?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2M2swNTU4MWJ4M253a3dhdWFlOTFtcTMiLCJ0aWQiOiJlMDc4MTJhNC01ZGY0LTRlOWEtODIzNy03YjQxZDIyZWMyNTQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQ5MTl9.NRB4PexmhDcWQ4-odgotLD70hAtIU8GhsuLUCU2g